    "basedOnRevision": "kling-o3-subjects-20260824",
    "changeNote": "Refresh seedance-2-5 and minimax-h3 against Kie's live OpenAPI specs, read 2026-09-03. seedance-2-5 gains the 1080p tier its spec declares and its real reference caps (images 5->30, videos 3->10, audios 3->10); the 30s combined-duration ceiling on reference videos is unchanged, so the extra slots buy more clips, not more footage. The 1080p rates are the UNDISCOUNTED figures (114/0.72 and 68.5/0.72, rounded up to 159 and 96): Kie's published 114/68.5 is a \"Limited-Time 1080P Offer: 28% OFF until Sep 17, 2026 06:00 UTC\" and pinning it would under-bill the tier the moment the offer lapses. 480p and 720p carry no discount and are unchanged. minimax-h3 gains its real caps (images 5->9, videos 1->3, audios 1->3) plus the two rules those caps make reachable: a 15s combined-duration ceiling on reference videos, and a forbidden combination for reference audio with no image or video beside it, which minimax-h3/reference-to-video rejects via anyOf[reference_image_urls, reference_video_urls]. No provider ids, adapters, availability or other pricing change.",
    "createdBy": "catalog refresh 2026-09-03 (Claude Code, operator athulsmanjeri@gmail.com)"
  },
